          "details": "拜衛尉少卿。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hixia8mcidj4",
      "text": "直龍圖閣",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "《宋史》卷三百三十二·遊師雄傳",
          "source_bid": "d59f2gonq7sy",
